# Vercel CLI uploads the local working directory more literally than a
# git-connected deploy does, so exclusions here are needed even though
# .gitignore already covers most of these paths.
#
# docs/source/ holds the original concept PDF (174 MB — far over Vercel's
# 100 MB per-file limit) and its rendered page images. Neither is runtime
# code; both exist only for local content-verification against
# docs/SOURCE_DATA.md and are never imported by the application.
docs/source/

# Regenerated on every build; never needed in the upload.
.next/
node_modules/

# Local dev/test artifacts.
*.log
.env.local
